          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Rainbow Islands: Towering Adventure! is a part of the Bubble Bobble series. And thus this game features slightly similar gameplay. You play as Bubby or Bobby (or both, with a friend) and have to make your way to the top of multiple long, vertical stages with the aid of rainbows, which you can create.",
